            "description": {
              "content": "Retrieves threat intelligence data for a security entity (IP address, domain, hash, email, or URL)\nthat is associated with a specific incident.\n\n**Authorization**: Validates that the requesting account has permission to view the incident\nand that the entity belongs to the incident.\n",
